	METHOD method_3709 detectCharset (Lcom/xk72/proxy/Fields;[B)Ljava/lang/String;
		COMMENT Four sources in order: the header's charset parameter, a UTF-32/UTF-16/UTF-8 byte order mark, an in-band declaration (<meta> content-type for text/html, the encoding pseudo-attribute for XML), then UTF-8 if the type is textual at all. Null when nothing says.
